<p class="chapeau">
    This blog is for anyone who is curious&nbsp;: no knowledge of music, of Latin or of
    medieval history is required. Step by step, we are going to learn how to
    «&nbsp;read&nbsp;» Gregorian chant as it is written in a fascinating book, the
    <em>Graduale Triplex</em>.
</p>

